            "title": "輝瑞旗下Mylan就Wegovy學名藥專利問題起訴諾和諾德",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"輝瑞旗下Mylan就Wegovy學名藥專利問題起訴諾和諾德\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b6fcc1a1f53341f6fd8e892c2b5a80e6d9a73192b7b33788929c9de23481c3e9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEA6H0CU_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">輝瑞旗下Mylan就Wegovy學名藥專利問題起訴諾和諾德</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 輝瑞（Viatris）旗下子公司Mylan製藥已在美國德拉瓦州聯邦法院對諾和諾德（Novo Nordisk）提起訴訟，要求法院裁定其計劃推出的Wegovy學名藥不侵犯這家丹麥藥企的專利權。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Mylan製藥於週四向法院申請裁定，其學名藥產品不侵犯諾和諾德就Wegovy單劑量注射筆減重用途所持有的給藥方法專利。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">根據諾和諾德公司報告，去年其旗下以司美格魯肽為基礎的減重藥物Wegovy及Ozempic合計創造了近310億美元的收入。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-6a80d4cc-8b3e-3996-933b-50fd1c9bbd00-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在諾和諾德針對司美格魯肽（即上述兩款藥物的活性成分）所持有的專利於2032年到期之前，Wegovy及Ozempic的學名藥版本均無法進入美國市場。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">諾和諾德此前已就Mylan及其他製藥商提出的Wegovy與Ozempic學名藥專利訴訟達成和解。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
